# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the runtime image needs.
# New files (secrets, state, venvs) stay out of the image by default.
*

!requirements.txt
!app/
!training/models/
!llm/docs/
!configs/
!prompts/

# Never ship these, even inside allowed folders
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
